Z||000000||MooCow||09-22-2001||10:34 PM||||Well I have really bad luck cause today as I was driving back to my house from my frineds house who lives about 5 houses away I cracked my tranny case.  Don't ask me how all I know is I have trail of tranny fluid from his house to my house. I looked under it and I can see a crack that is about 8 inches long.  Is it fixable&gt;?&gt;?  If I buy a new tranny what do I need to get??<BR>Anyone want a Fiero now??  I really dont have the know how nor the place to even start to work on the car.  Also I am in debt with car about $3,500 and now it broke.<BR>Any help would be great.<P>Thanks Ken<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_7.jpg"> <BR>87 GT, 3.4 engine with a 4:10 tranny, and Viper Yellow!||||reg||8
